WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.092 --> 00:00:02.960
- [Reporter] This is North
Korean state media footage

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.770
of leader Kim Jong-un from July last year.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:06.970
(reporter speaking in Korean)

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:08.650
And this is him about a year later,

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.370
where he appears to look thinner.

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:13.480
Kim's weight loss has gotten
a lot of people alarmed.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.479
From citizens.

00:00:14.479 --> 00:00:18.229
(citizen speaking in Korean)

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.660
- [Reporter] And some north Korean experts

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.550
have raised questions
about his weight loss

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:27.160
and what that means for the Kim regime.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.830
We don't know precisely why

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:31.010
Kim Jong-un has shed some pounds,

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:35.810
but what's clear is how Kim
Jong-un's thinner figure

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:39.180
is being used as propaganda
inside North Korea.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:42.200
South Korean spy agency estimates believe

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:46.130
that Kim Jong-un has gained
about 14 pounds a year

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:48.850
since taking over as the country's leader

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:50.540
nearly a decade ago.

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:53.530
This weight gain is intentional.

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.890
North Koreans like their
leaders to be plump.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:59.410
Also, Kim Jong-un has
tried to style himself,

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.010
both literally and figuratively,

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:02.960
like his grandfather Kim Il-sung,

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.510
who is revered across North Korea.

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:08.700
But these are tough
times for the Kim regime.

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:10.530
They're battling with the pandemic

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:14.260
but the regime has decided
to seal off its borders,

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:17.140
and that's created economic strife.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:18.860
Certainly, sanctions still exist.

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:21.240
So Kim Jong-un at various meetings

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:24.370
has been urging his
citizens to sacrifice more,

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:26.470
to tighten their belts.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:29.390
Kim Jong-un has mentioned
potential food shortages.

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:32.530
So the fact that Kim
Jong-un himself looks,

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:34.900
by his own standards, more gaunt,

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:37.710
this as a propaganda point can be used

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:40.330
to project to North Koreans

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:43.560
that Kim Jong-un is alongside
with the shared sacrifice,

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.980
that times are difficult for him too.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:49.680
There is no topic that's more
off limits inside North Korea

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.490
than the leader's health.

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:54.180
Experts say the fact that state media,

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.520
which is heavily curated and orchestrated,

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:00.100
chose to run interviews
articulating concern for Kim Jong-un

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.170
because of his weight loss shows

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:05.360
that this is not a grave health concern

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:07.920
but rather perhaps a rallying call.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.480
Experts say this is more of a message

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:14.190
to bolster spirits and to really reinforce

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:16.090
that Kim Jong-un is a
person for the people,

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:17.500
a leader for the people,

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.400
more so than an outward message.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.460
But to the outside world,

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:22.150
this is yet another reminder

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:25.143
of where Kim Jong-un's
attention is at the moment.

